## codex-wasm-transpiler at U64: both roads agree, the fixed point holds

    both roads    the two roads agree byte for byte; arith matches all 9 lines
    artifact      codexwasm.wat 9,299,476 bytes (U62: 8,713,721)
    memory        1,677.6 MB, 41.0% of wasm32; ratchet +1.33% (not rebanked)

`ebcdc00`. One fix, from U63: the effect-handler helpers (`wh-op-arity` and
the rest) moved out of WasmEmitter into `plugs/common/HandlerLift.codex`,
which upstream's wasm build line names with `-CommonChapters`. Our bundler
now reads that list from `codex/plugs/wasm/build.ps1`; without it, codexzig
refused the subject with eight CDX3002s. `CODEXZIG` must point at
codex-zig-transpiler's `generated/local/codexzig`, not `~/codexzig`: the
build reads the receipt at `../PROVENANCE` from the binary, and the bundle
dir has none there, so the pin reads UNVERIFIED.

